# ── Sensitive local operational data (DOC-083) ──────────────────────────────
# Real employee/customer data must never be tracked. These patterns exist
# because scripts/data/microlink-remove-employees.tsv once was. Runtime inputs
# belong here or outside the repository entirely.
.local-sensitive-data/
scripts/data/private/
scripts/data/local/

# Python bytecode from the scripts/_ssh_*.py operational tooling
